":[],"ruleId":"Lord::LORD::reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","sourceHeadwordId":"Lord"},"text":"Guard me, O LORD, from the hands of the wicked. Keep me safe from men of violence who scheme to make me stumble.","verse":4},{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"LORD","senseEvidence":{"basis":"reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","originalCitations":[],"ruleId":"Lord::LORD::reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","sourceHeadwordId":"Lord"},"text":"I say to the LORD, “You are my God.” Hear, O LORD, my cry for help.","verse":6},{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"LORD","senseEvidence":{"basis":"reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","originalCitations":[],"ruleId":"Lord::LORD::reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","sourceHeadwordId":"Lord"},"text":"Grant not, O LORD, the desires of the wicked; do not promote their evil plans, lest they be exalted. Selah","verse":8},{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"LORD","senseEvidence":{"basis":"reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","originalCitations":[],"ruleId":"Lord::LORD::reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","sourceHeadwordId":"Lord"},"text":"I know that the LORD upholds justice for the poor and defends the cause of the needy.","verse":12}],"id":"Lord","label":"LORD","matchReviews":[{"ruleId":"Lord::LORD::reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","scope":"reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","senseReview":"Only literal uppercase LORD is admitted globally. Source Lord article explicitly covers God as Lord; lowercase human lord and sentence-title Lord are not inferred from this rule.","sourceHeadwordId":"Lord","term":"LORD"}],"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","matchingRules":["reviewed_exact_headword"],"sourceProvenanceId":"Lord","sourceTitle":"Lord"},{"evidence":[{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"salvation","senseEvidence":{"basis":"source_verse_citation","originalCitations":[{"anchorIndex":16,"href":"?bref=Ps.140.7","rawReference":"Ps.140.7"}],"ruleId":"Salvation::Salvation::source_verse